  "summary_en": "MAS information paper presenting good practices for AI and Generative AI model risk management observed in a thematic review of Singapore banks. It covers governance and oversight, AI identification, inventory, risk materiality, development, validation, deployment, monitoring, generative AI and third-party AI. FIs are expected to take reference from it.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Banks should establish AI governance and oversight with clear accountability, including cross-functional bodies.",
   "Maintain an AI inventory and assess risk materiality using impact, complexity and reliance.",
   "Apply standards for data management, development, explainability, fairness and validation proportionate to risk.",
   "Set deployment, monitoring and change management controls, including for Generative AI and third-party AI.",
   "Good practices apply generally to other financial institutions."
  ],
